  "provenance": "P2S. Nozzle: tip bands of the Bambu quick-swap hotend (0.6 mm land, 35-degree cone capped at 2 mm radius, from https://www.printables.com/model/533213 Hotend.STEP as in bambu-a1), clipped at the BambuStudio nozzle_height floor; Bambu's FAQ says this nozzle family is shared by H2D and P2S (https://wiki.bambulab.com/en/p2s/manual/p2s-faq) and its High Flow hotend is sold for H2/P2S (https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/bambu-high-flow-hotend-h2-p2s). BambuStudio P2S preset (https://github.com/bambulab/BambuStudio/tree/master/resources/profiles/BBL/machine): nozzle_height 4.2, extruder_clearance_height_to_rod 32.5, dist_to_rod 36.5 -> gantry underside Z 32.5, symmetric Y span +-36.5, infinite X. Sock: quick-swap sock as bambu-a1 from the floor. Ducts and housing: P-series layout of bambu-p1s (OEM front housing https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/front-housing-assembly-p1p), outlets lowered to 1 mm over the floor; redesigned P2S toolhead per https://blog.bambulab.com/the-icon-redefined-meet-the-p2s-a-completely-reengineered-version-of-the-ultra-productive-p1-series. Body boxes are estimates from Bambu wiki/store toolhead photos with the BambuStudio clearances as hard anchors; axial/lateral margins 0.3 mm. Nozzle-tip frame +X right, +Y rear, +Z up, mm. Derived 2026-11-11; calibrated=false.",
